====================================================================================================
KA9  which sign is the material stress?   and does it balance the law's halo?
====================================================================================================
A static medium needs div(sigma) = + rho_c grad Phi (tensile-positive Cauchy stress).
For a point mass Phi = -GM/r, so dPhi/dr = +g > 0 and the condition reads (div sigma)_r = +rho_c g.
