S0  the deformation, from mass conservation alone (no constitutive law)
====================================================================================================
R(r) = [3 M_c(r) / (4 pi rho_ref)]^(1/3)   (Lagrangian radius of the mass now inside r)
u_rr = 1 - dR/dr ,  u_tt = 1 - R/r ,   u_rr - u_tt = R/r - dR/dr = y (1 - rho_c/rho_bar_c)
rho_ref: z0 33.92  z2 915.8  z5 7326.7  z10 45147.3  Msun/kpc^3   (5.41 x Omega_b x rho_crit x (1+z)^3)

