A solid carries a dispersion elastically only while c_T^2 = mu_s/rho_c >~ sigma_v^2. Here
c_T^2 is real and positive but only 18966799118-119672412088 km^2/s^2, against sigma_v^2 = 1e6: the elastic
sound speed is 6-25 times SMALLER than the dispersion the cluster requires, so the medium
MELTS in every cluster row (it cannot be hot and solid at once). "Full share" (RB1 gate 1,
f_ret -> 1) is satisfied by construction for any real-mass medium and carries no information.

====================================================================================================
S4  recombination and the expanding universe (reported)
====================================================================================================
The homogeneous reference state has xi = 0, hence sigma = 0 and the background is exactly dust
at the background level: there is no non-gravitational coupling to the plasma by construction,
so the drag bound that killed MEDIUM_DESIGN section 3's baryon-coupled medium does not arise.

Constitutive law carried out of the halo (S1c): mu_s = +(3/2) J(g) (rho_ref/(3 rho_c))^(1/3).
At the background rho_c = rho_ref, so mu_s = +0.693 J(g_bg) > 0.
  - in the exactly homogeneous background g = 0, so mu_s = 0: the medium is a shear-free dust
    (a solid with zero shear modulus is not a solid). Recombination passes trivially, and vacuously.
  - in any perturbed region g != 0, so mu_s > 0 and the transverse mode PROPAGATES with a real
    c_T. The elastic Jeans length lambda_J = c_L sqrt(pi/(G rho_c)) is then real:
  canonical z=1100   g/a0=1.0e-06   mu_s=8.027e-02  c_T=1.332e-06 km/s  lambda_J=5.349e-09 kpc (5.349e-12 Mpc)
  canonical z=1100   g/a0=1.0e-04   mu_s=8.026e+02  c_T=1.332e-04 km/s  lambda_J=5.349e-07 kpc (5.349e-10 Mpc)
  canonical z=1100   g/a0=1.0e-02   mu_s=7.974e+06  c_T=1.327e-02 km/s  lambda_J=5.331e-05 kpc (5.331e-08 Mpc)
  alt       z=1100   g/a0=1.0e-06   mu_s=1.172e-01  c_T=1.609e-06 km/s  lambda_J=6.464e-09 kpc (6.464e-12 Mpc)
  alt       z=1100   g/a0=1.0e-04   mu_s=1.172e+03  c_T=1.609e-04 km/s  lambda_J=6.464e-07 kpc (6.464e-10 Mpc)
  alt       z=1100   g/a0=1.0e-02   mu_s=1.165e+07  c_T=1.604e-02 km/s  lambda_J=6.443e-05 kpc (6.443e-08 Mpc)

  The acoustic peaks live at comoving 100-200 Mpc and the damping tail at a few Mpc.
  Compare the comoving scale: lambda_J is in PHYSICAL kpc at z = 1100, so comoving
  lambda_J(1+z). Read the last column x 1101.

====================================================================================================
M5  the three hypotheses, checked against the solid as constructed
====================================================================================================
(i)  LOCAL: the stress is an algebraic function of the state at the same point. YES -- S1c shows
     mu_s and lambda are functions of (rho_c, g) alone (rho_ref is a constant of the material).
     The strain enters as a state variable; that enlarges M5's S2 ansatz Pi(rho, grad Phi) but
     does not drop locality.
(ii) MOMENTUM-CONSERVING: sigma is symmetric and the force density is div sigma; there is no
     external hold, no tether, no sink. YES.
(iii) NORMALLY SELF-GRAVITATING: rho_c appears in del^2 Phi = 4 pi G (rho_b + rho_c) with no
     cancellation and no screening. YES.

All three hold. M5's NO-GO therefore applies. It shows up here as:
   - the density-blind unique stress (M5 S2): the equilibrium stress is forced to be -Pi(g),
     and the moduli it forces are positive but of a size fixed by the reference density;
     the solid does not escape the uniqueness, it only supplies a strain to hang it on.
   - the energy is not the medium's own (S2): W = (J/2)(5y/3 - 1) is 4 to 95 times J through
     the halo, and J itself is the pressure of FB1's isothermal halo, not a strain energy.
   - the displacement is NOT attractor-selected: the strain is fixed by mass conservation
     from a reference density that is a global property of the assembly history (y = R/r),
     so the state the medium must be in is not reachable by any local relaxation.
   What the solid buys by being a solid: the transverse mode propagates with a real c_T
   (M5 S4's Hadamard disease is cured in the shear sector), and both sound speeds are
   subluminal. That is a real gain. It is not enough: the state cannot be reached (S0),
   the energy does not match (S2), the solid melts in clusters (S3) and yields in the
   Bullet (B1).

